{
  "key": 46175,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_GatherThreePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a statue of a Pokémon.\n",
        "It seems to exude power...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} read the engraved\n",
        "writing...\r",
        "A body of rock.\r",
        "A body of ice.\r",
        "A body of steel.\r",
        "When gathers the three Pokémon,\n",
        "the king shall appear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_KingShallAppear",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a statue of a Pokémon.\n",
        "It seems to exude power...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} read the engraved\n",
        "writing...\r",
        "A body of rock.\r",
        "A body of ice.\r",
        "A body of steel.\r",
        "When gathers the three Pokémon,\n",
        "the king shall appear.\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_RegigigasCry",
      "en_US": "...Zut zutt!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_RegigigasDisappeared",
      "en_US": "REGIGIGAS disappeared from view..."
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_SovereignMayleneSituation",
      "en_US": [
        "Maylene: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I guess you made it to Snowpoint!\r",
        "You can probably see Candice and I\n",
        "are in a bit of a situation...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_SovereignCandiceHelpUs",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice: Hiya!\n",
        "I haven’t seen you before!\r",
        "Are you here to help Candice?\r",
        "This big Pokémon here is awakening from\n",
        "a long slumber.\r",
        "But that isn’t good for anyone...\n",
        "We need to put it back to sleep!\r",
        "We just need a little more power.\n",
        "So come and help us out!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_SovereignCandiceBackToSleep",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice: That should put it back\n",
        "to sleep for a while... Whew.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_SovereignCandiceThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice: Thanks for the help!\n",
        "You’re a real superstar!\r",
        "This is the legendary REGIGIGAS,\n",
        "who sleeps within our temple.\r",
        "But it was like it was waking up...\n",
        "There were tremors all over town.\r",
        "Anyway, it didn’t awaken fully, so\n",
        "there’s no harm done!\r",
        "Let me give you this as a gift for\n",
        "helping us out.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_SovereignCandiceRockClimb",
      "en_US": [
        "Rock Climb allows you to scale sheer\n",
        "cliff faces using your Pokémon.\r",
        "However, you need the Icicle Badge\n",
        "to be able to use it.\r",
        "And that’s where I come in!\r",
        "As the Snowpoint City Gym Leader,\n",
        "I’ll be waiting inside the city’s Gym.\r",
        "See you soon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointTempleB5F_Text_SovereignMayleneThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Maylene: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\n",
        "I’d like to thank you as well.\r",
        "We’ll keep training hard so that\n",
        "we can battle with you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
